  "description": "The Vaporesso XROS 3 is a simple-to-use yet extremely satisfying pod kit that offers fuss-free, flavoursome MTL (mouth-to-lung ) and even RDTL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping in a sleek, lightweight and compact form factor. The Xros 3 from Vaporesso is available in eight dazzling colours to suit your personal style, and features an even more ergonomic finish than its predecessor, with a textured panel on one side for improved grip and a silky-smooth finish on the other. With its sleek, compact form-factor, the XROS 3 kit feels lightweight yet solid in the hand and is discreet and light enough to carry everywhere. The Vaporesso Xros 3 features an integrated 1000mAh battery that ensures reliable all-day vaping, assisted by super-fast USB Type-C charging. An illuminated neon strip at the base indicates how much charge your battery has left. Powered by Vaporesso’s advanced Axon chipset , the Xros 3 features a Pulse mode to boost the flavour even further. For even more control, the adjustable airflow slider lets you adjust your draw, from tight and intense to loose and airy. You can operate the device with the fire button or the Vaporesso Xros 3 kit’s auto-inhale mode, which means you can fire the Xros 3 by simply taking a puff on the pod’s mouthpiece. The action is similar to taking a puff on a traditional cigarette, making the Xros 3 pod kit ideal for newer vapers and recent ex-smokers. The Vaporesso Xros 3 is compatible with all the disposable pods within the Xros family, but the kit includes the updated Xros Pod with an integrated 1.0ohm coil for an intensely satisfying MTL (mouth-to-lung) sensation with classic high-PG , 50/50 and nic salt e-liquids, as well as a new Xros pod with a 0.6ohm integrated coil for a smooth and billowy RDTL (restricted direct-to-lung) experience ideal for use with 50/50 e-liquids. Vaporesso’s Corex heating technology and the pod’s coils’ unique morph-mesh structure ensures more rapid and even heating for improved flavour accuracy. The 2ml pods employ Vaporesso’s SSS Leak-Resistant Technology and a top filling port beneath the detachable cap to ensure refills are quick and clean. And when your coil begins to lose its flavour, simply replace with a new XROS pod. Sleek, stylish and so easy to use, the new Vaporesso XROS 3 Pod Kit delivers exceptional MTL and RDTL vaping with the redesigned Xros fixed-coil pods Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
